## Model card

- **Name:** Ling 3.0 Flash VL
- **Short description:** InclusionAI's multimodal Ling model (released 2026-09-10) for visual analysis, planning and tool use — the vision-language member of the Ling 3.0 Flash family.
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter (`inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-vl`), LLM Gateway, Vercel, NanoGPT, Novita, plus ~5 routes. Open weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-10 (models.dev; BenchLM record Sep 4, 2026); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `ling-3.0-flash-vl`, `inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-vl`, `inclusionai/Ling-3.0-Flash-VL`.
- **Context window:** 131,072 on OpenRouter/LLM Gateway; 256,000 (Vercel) / 262,144 (NanoGPT, Novita); max output 32,768.
- **Modalities:** text, image and video in; text out; reasoning and tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** $0.06 / $0.18 per 1M input/output; cache read $0.012 (Vercel/Novita $0.075/$0.22).
- **Architecture:** open-weight MoE (InclusionAI / Ant Group).

