## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM's profile (`benchlm.ai/models/ling-3-0-flash-vl`) reports "tracked, but not publicly ranked yet" with **0** sourced benchmark rows.
- models.dev carries the model (2026-09-10, 131K–262K context, $0.06/$0.18, text/image/video in) but no benchmark fields.
- No vendor blog or Ant Group technical report with a benchmark table was reachable for the VL SKU in this pass; the text-only Ling 3.0 Flash / 3.1 Flash / 3.2 Flash figures were deliberately **not** transferred (different checkpoints).
- Resolution: spec facts above are catalog-verified; the benchmark columns stay empty until InclusionAI publishes a Ling 3.0 Flash VL scorecard.

